  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/:PASSIVE:|MalGanisVampiricTouch|Trait",
    "value": "对敌方英雄造成的<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">50%</c>伤害治疗玛尔加尼斯，对非英雄单位造成的<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">15%</c>伤害治疗玛尔加尼斯。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/ArthasArmyOfTheDead|ArthasArmyOfTheDead|Heroic",
    "value": "召唤<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">6</c>只食尸鬼，食尸鬼的生命值为<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">1200</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>，会在<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">20</c>秒内持续衰减。食尸鬼跟随阿尔萨斯行动，并会攻击附近敌人，造成<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">20</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>伤害。<n/><n/>重新激活以献祭<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">1</c>只食尸鬼，为阿尔萨斯恢复<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">240</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>生命值。该效果有<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">2</c>秒冷却时间。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/GarroshArmorUpDoubleUp|GarroshArmorUpDoubleUp|Trait",
    "value": "铁甲加身可以手动激活，使护甲加成提高<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">100%</c>，持续<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">5</c>秒。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/MalGanisNightRush|MalGanisNightRush|E",
    "value": "<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">0.62</c>秒后，获得<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">50%</c>移动速度，持续<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">2</c>秒。激活时，玛尔加尼斯可以穿过敌方英雄，并使他们沉睡<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">2.5</c>秒。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/NexusHunterBloodRage|NexusHunterBloodRage|W",
    "value": "琪拉造成<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">32</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>点伤害，每一名受影响的敌方英雄可以使琪拉恢复<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">90</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>点生命值。每多叠加一层该效果，伤害和治疗就提高<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">50%</c>。<n/><n/><c val=\"00ff90\" hlt-name=\"#AbilityPassive\">被动：</c>普通攻击和技能伤害使敌人流血，在<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">4</c>秒内造成<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">28</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>点伤害。可叠加<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">5</c>层。<n/><n/><img path=\"@UI/StormTalentInTextQuestIcon\" alignment=\"uppermiddle\" color=\"B48E4C\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\"/><c val=\"e4b800\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipQuest\">任务：</c>在血怒的流血效果对敌方英雄造成伤害后，其伤害永久提高<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">0.2%</c>。<n/><n/><img path=\"@UI/StormTalentInTextQuestIcon\" alignment=\"uppermiddle\" color=\"B48E4C\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\"/><c val=\"e4b800\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipQuest\">奖励：</c>在血怒的流血效果对敌方英雄造成<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">150</c>次伤害后，血怒的持续时间增加<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">2</c>秒。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/WhitemaneDesperatePlea|WhitemaneDesperatePlea|Q",
    "value": "恢复一名友方英雄<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">140</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>点生命值并获得一层<c val=\"FF8B8B\" hlt-name=\"#WhitemaneDesperation\">绝望</c>效果，持续<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">4</c>秒。<n/><n/><c val=\"FF8B8B\" hlt-name=\"#WhitemaneDesperation\">绝望</c>会使绝望祈求的法力消耗提高<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">40</c>点，最多叠加<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">3</c>次。<n/><n/><c val=\"ffff8a\">当前法力消耗：</c> <c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">45</c>"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/ZagaraSummonHydralisk|ZagaraHunterKiller|W",
    "value": "召唤一只刺蛇攻击单个目标，每秒造成<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">71</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.05~~</c>点伤害。刺蛇在<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">10</c>秒内将持续失去生命值，总共拥有<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">500</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.045~~</c>点生命值。"
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/items/ability/fullText/XalatathDarkHeartRitual|XalatathDarkHeartRitual|E",
    "value": "放置一个使周围敌人减速<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">35%</c>的图腾。该图腾拥有<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">260</c><c val=\"a7a7a7\" hlt-name=\"#ColorGray\">~~0.04~~</c>点生命值，持续<c val=\"bfd4fd\" hlt-name=\"#TooltipNumbers\">6</c>秒。"
  },
